<title>USA: Baroid acquires Desert Drilling Fluids Inc.</title>
<headline>Baroid acquires Desert Drilling Fluids Inc.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baroid Drilling Fluids Inc said on Wednesday it acquired Desert Drilling Fluids Inc (DDF), a Nevada corporation with operations in five states and business partnerships in several other countries.</p>
<p>Baroid Drilling Fluids Inc is a subsidiary of Dresser Industries Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
